    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Sex on the Beach</strong> \u2014 where the only thing more unreliable than your love life is the Wi-Fi signal.<br>Forget sunscreen, because your inhibitions are about to get seriously burned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/68edb3a0a2cc0c60f4adecc9ba27ddda.poster.avif?t=1754724573\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/68edb3a0a2cc0c60f4adecc9ba27ddda.webm?t=1754724573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/68edb3a0a2cc0c60f4adecc9ba27ddda.mp4?t=1754724573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sex on the Beach</strong> isn\u2019t just a naughty sandbox \u2014 it\u2019s a massive open-world adult playground where you control everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Huge tropical map with explorable islands<br>\u2705 100+ sex animations<br>\u2705 AI &amp; NPC interaction<br>\u2705 Advanced character &amp; NPC customization<br>\u2705 Jet skis, boats, masks, toys, blindfolds, dildos \u2014 and total freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No boring missions. No story walls. Just raw, sexy freedom.<br>You choose how, where, and with whom \u2014 solo or with AI, NPS and real players online.<br><br>\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Explore a tropical paradise full of questionable decisions, flirtatious NPCs, and locations that are definitely not suitable for grandma.<br>\ud83d\udea4 Cruise around on jet skis or boats \u2014 because even in an adult game, transportation matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/b9c6094bb7c0565f3a85d0b024aa19b5.poster.avif?t=1754724573\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/b9c6094bb7c0565f3a85d0b024aa19b5.webm?t=1754724573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/b9c6094bb7c0565f3a85d0b024aa19b5.mp4?t=1754724573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfad Customize yourself from head to toe \u2014 want to be a mysterious masked stranger or a bearded beach god? You got it.<br>Oh, and yes, blindfolds. Because why not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Play solo, multiplayer, or just pretend you're busy while your avatar does all the naughty stuff for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/c4f1635d2605ec9dab8382bde43a190c.poster.avif?t=1754724573\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/c4f1635d2605ec9dab8382bde43a190c.webm?t=1754724573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967800/extras/c4f1635d2605ec9dab8382bde43a190c.mp4?t=1754724573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, ready to trade your boring reality for a beach party that never stops?<br><strong>Dive in, get a little weird, and have some fun.</strong> Your beach towel might never be the same.</p>",
